WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:07.034
This is Light Orchestra. The app on your Mac makes the sound, and any phone on the same network becomes the instrument.

00:07.134 --> 00:12.886
Open the invite, tap Join, and start playing. Everything you hear was recorded live from the app.

00:16.950 --> 00:21.814
Slide across the ribbon to play. Move right for higher notes, and up for more expression.

00:21.914 --> 00:29.250
Put more fingers down to play chords. Every touch goes straight to a synthesiser written in Osprey, compiled to native code.

00:42.383 --> 00:47.086
Pick another instrument: a warm bass, an electric lead, or an F M texture.

00:47.186 --> 00:54.523
Then choose what your finger shapes, like echo or reverb. Effects stay set as you switch, so you can build the sound as you play.
